"Read file.txt" Server: "OK, reading..." (2 seconds frozen) User 2: "Read data.json" Server: "Still reading file.txt... wait" User 3: "Get my profile" Server: "Still reading...

20
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:20,000
keep waiting" Server can only handle ONE thing at a time. Users 2 and 3 are blocked by User 1's file read. With Event Loop

21
