(Non-blocking) User 1: "Read file.txt" Server: "Started reading file.txt. I'll tell you when done." User 2: "Read data.json" Server: "Started reading data.json. I'll tell you

22
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:40,000
when done." User 3: "Get my profile" Server: "Here's your profile (from memory, instantly)." Server starts all operations immediately. When file.txt finishes, User 1 gets

23
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:50,000
their response. When data.json finishes, User 2 gets their response. NO ONE WAITS FOR ANYONE ELSE. How Async Operations Are Handled The Flow of an

